Package: childpen
Title: Identification and Estimation of Child Penalties
Version: 0.3.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Dor", "Leventer", 
           email = "leventerdor@gmail.com", 
           role = c("aut", "cre")))
Description: Estimators from Leventer (2025), "Identification of Child Penalties"
    <doi:10.48550/arXiv.2602.07486>: within-gender difference-in-differences,
    triple differences, the conventional normalized estimator with a
    bias-bounding exercise, the effect of parenthood on the gender earnings
    ratio under normalized and proportional triple differences, the accounting
    of the gender gap, and aggregation across treatment groups, with
    influence-function standard errors clustered by person.
